WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:03.900
Meet Nova. A browser built around the way you work.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.650
Keep your day in focus with a clean start page,

00:08.650 --> 00:11.650
flexible tabs, and separate workspaces.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.450
Explore ideas with your sidebar assistant.

00:16.450 --> 00:20.650
Supported models run locally on your device, using WebGPU.

00:21.500 --> 00:26.050
Free and open source. For Mac, Windows, and Linux.

00:27.800 --> 00:31.200
Find your space. Make room for Nova.
